  {
   "id": "i-am-your-beast-305180@hotfix-2026-10-28",
   "gameId": "i-am-your-beast-305180",
   "displayName": "Hotfix - 10/28/2026",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-28T22:50:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're so grateful for the response to I Am Your Beast's Quitting Time DLC! A number of you have identified some bugs, and we wanted to give you an update on our priorities for fixing them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've already fixed issues related to the weapon and item highlight system and mismatched dialogue and typos, some overly aggressive out-of-bounds areas, geometry issues that could result in the player being stuck, and a UI bug with the opening cutscene. We've also addressed the sniper and RPG enemy warning icon that wasn't appearing in most levels. We've identified a problem with this element specifically in horde levels. We're investigating this and will keep you updated.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additionally, we're currently investigating the following issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Twitch integration improperly hooking into Harding's lines",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Death From Above (base game), the \"Open the Gates\" cutscene is improperly skipping",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Performance issues: we're working to surface additional fidelity options to give you greater control (and avoid this issue)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Level select scrolling has become difficult with the mouse since we added the Quitting Time DLC pack and extended the list. Desired behavior would be to ensure the mouse scroll wheel allows you to move through the entire list.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Additionally, we've had some reports about a couple of things that are working as intended.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Never Stop (Quitting Time DLC), the helicopter will see you even if you haven't broken stealth. This is narratively accurate. The helicopter pilot knows you're in the area, even if the ground troops haven't detected you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are some moments that have a portrait linger after the voice line ends, that’s on purpose!.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Again, thank you for reporting these issues and giving us the data to make this DLC the experience we intend it to be and that this community deserves. We'll continue to keep you updated on additional bug fixes as they roll out. Please do keep reporting them in the Steam Discussions or in the Strange Scaffold Discord server.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mike @ Strange Scaffold",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
