  {
   "id": "i-am-your-beast-305180@hotfix-2026-10-21",
   "gameId": "i-am-your-beast-305180",
   "displayName": "Quitting Time Hotfix - 10/20/2026",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-21T09:34:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, friends! Firstly, thank you all so much for the huge response to \"Quitting Time\"! We had a number of very useful bug reports and little bits of feedback (keep them coming by the way, it honestly helps us find things even all our testing didn't spot!), so here are the fixes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed music on pause menu on some levels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed text issues in cutscene 3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed dialogue missmatch on level 8",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed scroll wheel navigation on main menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Updated sub objective \"Shield Kills\" to \"Shield Throw Kills\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed description of Don't Step in Mud objective",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue that caused player mud slow to not deactivate in some cases",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added the new Achievement Sets so those who don't have the DLC yet should still have their 100%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Again, thank you all so much for your support on the first day. I Am Your Beast is without doubt the most impactful game we've made so going back and making this DLC was mostly because people were asking for more! It's been over two years since the first game came out so the continued support and excitement is humbling and exciting!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you out there,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chris @ Strange Scaffold",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
