  {
   "id": "i-am-your-beast-305180@major-2024-10-25",
   "gameId": "i-am-your-beast-305180",
   "displayName": "Feature Update and Bug Fixes October 2024",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-25T20:44:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey, everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve just released a new update that adds some expanded features and quality of life updates, these include:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Expanded level overview",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Giving you more info about each kill after you finish the level, making planning your next run a little easier.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Graphics Settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Toggle post processing and lighting quality",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Full Mixed Input Support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gyro users should find this incredibly helpful!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gore Toggle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Less blood, same action",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Left Handed Mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Harding now holds their (or more than likely a COI guards) gun in their left hand.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Crouch bug fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Default reticle displays when using traps/equipment instead of the 'no entry' one",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Snowmen can now be kicked (if you are so inclined)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enemy radio displays correctly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Throwable objects no longer hit bullet shells",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A number of other small bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You’ll also find some UI updates on the main menu that lets your cycle through multiple new features, general performance improvements and a number of bug fixes (listed above).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And with all of that completed, we can additionally say we're very close to some bigger updates we discussed in our post launch roadmap which launches very soon! These include:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gamepad Remapping",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "No Timer Mode",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ability to select specific bonus objectives before starting a level",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ability to select level groups.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve been blown away by the support I Am Your Beast has received and it’s thanks to all of you that we have been able to continue supporting this game. THANK YOU!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you on the internet,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Strange Scaffold.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
