  {
   "id": "i-am-your-beast-305180@major-2024-09-25",
   "gameId": "i-am-your-beast-305180",
   "displayName": "Clip Creation Update Is Now Live!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-25T10:40:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey, everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the first of a number of updates, we’ve added a new beta feature that lets you capture those best runs directly in I Am Your Beast!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once you enable the clip feature in the settings menu, the game will record your run, and at the end, you can choose to keep it or move on! The video will be stored in your Video folder.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From there, you can share it wherever you like! Our Discord is a great place (you’ll find a handy button in-game), but wherever video is supported, so is your clip!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The team has been blown away by the clips we’ve seen posted online so far (negative times, anyone?!), so we wanted to make the whole process as easy as possible!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you (and your clips) on the internet!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Strange Scaffold.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
